  // own files: --no-gitignore and --no-ignore leave .gitignore and .ignore exactly as the customer
  // keeps them, and graft/ is kept out of the agent's diff the LOCAL way, in .git/info/exclude,
  // which is not tracked and is not the customer's to review.
